  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> <a style=\"color: #ff0000;\" href=\"https://www.aiimsexams.ac.in/info/Recruitments_new.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">All India Institute of Medical Sciences (AIIMS), New Delhi</a>, </span>has released the Re-Exam City Details for the various Common Recruitment Examination (CRE) Group-B and Group-C Posts. This <span class=\"google-anno-t\">recruitment</span> was released for 1485 posts. Applications for the AIIMS CRE Group B, C Recruitment 2026 were accepted from 13 June 2026, to 03 July 2026. The Re-Exam is going to be conducted on 31 August &amp; 01 September 2026. &nbsp;Candidates who had applied this form can download their AIIMS CRE 5th Group B &amp; C Re-Exam City Details 2026 from the link given below.</span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">All India Institute of Medical Sciences (AIIMS)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">AIIMS CRE 5th Group B &amp; C Re-Exam City Details 2026</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>13 June 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <strong>03 July 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>03 July 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">NOC Submit Form :<strong>&nbsp;08 July 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Application Status Available : <strong>11 July 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Exam Date : <strong>25-27 July 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Admit Card :<b> August 2026</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Result Declared Date : <strong>11 August 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; background-color: #ffff00;\">Re-Exam Date : <strong>31 August &amp; 01 September 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Re-Exam City Details : <strong>24 August 2026</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General, OBC : <strong>Rs. 3000/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC, ST, EWS :<strong> Rs. 2400/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">For PwD :<strong> 0/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[adinserter block=”3″]</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>AIIMS CRE Group B &amp; C Various Post Notification 2026 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Age Limit As On AIIMS Rules</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Minimum Age :&nbsp;<strong>18 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>21-50 Years (Post Wise)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per AIIMS CRE Group B &amp; C Various Post Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Use <span style=\"background-color: #ffff00; color: #0000ff;\"> </span>Tool –</span> </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>AIIMS CRE Group B &amp; C Various Post 2026 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Posts : 1484</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>No. of Post</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">AIIMS CRE Group B &amp; C Various Post</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">1484</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>AIIMS CRE Group B &amp; C Various Post Recruitment 2026 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 28.1434%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 71.8566%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Qualifications</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 28.1434%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">AIIMS CRE 5th Group B, C</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 71.8566%;\">\n<ul>\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"98\" data-end=\"233\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates must have passed&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"113\" data-end=\"128\">10th / 12th</strong>,&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"130\" data-end=\"144\">Graduation</strong>, or&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"149\" data-end=\"168\">Post Graduation</strong>&nbsp;in any discipline from a recognized university or possess an equivalent qualification recognized by the Government. In addition,&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"298\" data-end=\"346\">one year of relevant experience is mandatory</strong>. For more information, please check the&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"387\" data-end=\"421\">post-wise eligibility criteria</strong>&nbsp;for complete details on&nbsp;<strong>Official Notification.</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>How To Download AIIMS CRE 5th Group B, C Re-Exam City Details 2026</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">In order to download their Re-Exam City Details candidates are required to go to the important link section provided below.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">After getting the link candidates need to click it for Checking their Re-Exam City Details.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates need to provide their following details-:</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Registration No. /Roll No.</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>DOB/Password</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Captcha Code(if specified)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">After providing their details appropriately candidates will be able to check their Re-Exam City Details.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates can also check their Re-Exam City Details from official site of the AIIMS.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>AIIMS CRE Group B &amp; C Various Post Recruitment 2026 : Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Computer Based Test (CBT)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Medium of Examination</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[adinserter block=”3″]</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable2\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><strong>Follow Our Instagram Channel</strong></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><b>Join Our WhatsApp Channel</b></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong><a href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Follow Now</a></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; padding: 0px;\" colspan=\"7\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3><strong>Important Links</strong></h3>\n</td>\n<